<PageTitle>Aspire Reference - Aspire</PageTitle>
<HeadContent>
    <meta name="description" content="Comprehensive reference documentation for Aspire — CLI tools, APIs, and command-line reference materials." />
</HeadContent>

<TopicHero
    Icon="json"
    Title="The tools you need,"
    Highlight="at your fingertips."
    Subtitle="From the interactive CLI to the full API surface — everything you need to build, run, and deploy Aspire applications is documented here."
    Accent="cyan"
    FloatingIcons="@(new[] { "terminal", "document", "open-book", "magnifier", "laptop" })"
    PrimaryCta="@(("CLI overview", "/reference/cli/overview/"))"
    SecondaryCta="@(("Browse samples", "/reference/samples/"))" />

<h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mt-10 mb-3 text-base-900 dark:text-base-100 pb-2 border-b border-base-200 dark:border-base-700">The Aspire CLI</h2>
<p class="text-[0.95rem] leading-relaxed text-base-500 dark:text-base-400 mb-4 max-w-3xl [&_a]:text-primary-500 dark:[&_a]:text-primary-300">The <code>aspire</code> CLI is a cross-platform, interactive-first tool that manages the full lifecycle of your distributed applications — from scaffolding to deployment.</p>

<h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mt-10 mb-3 text-base-900 dark:text-base-100 pb-2 border-b border-base-200 dark:border-base-700">Core commands</h2>
<p class="text-[0.95rem] leading-relaxed text-base-500 dark:text-base-400 mb-4 max-w-3xl [&_a]:text-primary-500 dark:[&_a]:text-primary-300">Every <code>aspire</code> command is designed to be discoverable and interactive. Pass <code>--help</code> to any command for inline documentation.</p>

<CapabilityGrid Columns="3" Capabilities="@_coreCommands" />

<h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mt-10 mb-3 text-base-900 dark:text-base-100 pb-2 border-b border-base-200 dark:border-base-700">More commands</h2>

<CapabilityGrid Columns="3" Capabilities="@_moreCommands" />

<h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mt-10 mb-3 text-base-900 dark:text-base-100 pb-2 border-b border-base-200 dark:border-base-700">API reference</h2>

<FeatureShowcase Features="@_apiReference" />

<h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mt-10 mb-3 text-base-900 dark:text-base-100 pb-2 border-b border-base-200 dark:border-base-700">Samples</h2>
<p class="text-[0.95rem] leading-relaxed text-base-500 dark:text-base-400 mb-4 max-w-3xl [&_a]:text-primary-500 dark:[&_a]:text-primary-300">Explore fully functional sample projects that demonstrate real-world patterns and best practices with Aspire — from e-commerce apps with databases and caching, to multi-language integrations with JavaScript and Python, to cloud deployments with Azure Functions.</p>

<FeatureShowcase Features="@_samples" />

<h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mt-10 mb-3 text-base-900 dark:text-base-100 pb-2 border-b border-base-200 dark:border-base-700">Diagnostics</h2>
<p class="text-[0.95rem] leading-relaxed text-base-500 dark:text-base-400 mb-4 max-w-3xl [&_a]:text-primary-500 dark:[&_a]:text-primary-300">Every diagnostic Aspire emits falls into one of two categories. Both help you catch issues early — before they become runtime problems.</p>

<CapabilityGrid Columns="2" Capabilities="@_diagnostics" />

<CTABanner
    Title="Ready to get hands-on?"
    Description="Install the CLI and start building your first distributed application in minutes."
    PrimaryCta="@(("Install the Aspire CLI", "/docs/get-started/setup-and-tooling/install-cli/"))"
    SecondaryCta="@(("Build your first app", "/docs/get-started/first-app/"))" />

